{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an ordinary mushroom who accidentally acquires the power of shadows from nowhere, allowing you to convert your attacks into shadows and then use them to fight back against enemies. Yes, mushrooms also have dreams, as the lowest species in the &quot;capital&quot;, it has always been the fate of being eaten. Now, the roles are reversed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything has to be done one step at a time, and that starts with the nearest Chitter forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will encounter a variety of &quot;chitter&quot; here, and your shadow power will get a variety of upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread spores everywhere, and end up filling the forest with mushrooms.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589210?t=1743038084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589210/1f7a76dc7ba0dafff42d387a310498b9f2091a6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743038084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589210/de4510b9925598989c7a0b83fd6f3f128c07e406/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743038084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589210/de4510b9925598989c7a0b83fd6f3f128c07e406/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743038084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an ordinary mushroom who accidentally acquires the power of shadows from nowhere, allowing you to convert your attacks into shadows and then use them to fight back against enemies. Yes, mushrooms also have dreams, as the lowest species in the &quot;capital&quot;, it has always been the fate of being eaten. Now, the roles are reversed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything has to be done one step at a time, and that starts with the nearest Chitter forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will encounter a variety of &quot;chitter&quot; here, and your shadow power will get a variety of upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread spores everywhere, and end up filling the forest with mushrooms.</p>","developers":["TheMushroomOfShadow"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589210/eb40226ea5624bcb2aecaa6ee52d5f69cec9eefe/header.jpg?t=1743038084","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114625,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114625/movie480.mp4?t=1743038082","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114625/movie_max.mp4?t=1743038082"},"name":"\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114625/238040807bd39f62b91d1464a66bb6df95f3e873/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743038082","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114625/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743038082","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114625/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743038082"}}],"name":"The Mushroom Of Shadow","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7/win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versi